errors.Is(err, ErrDuplicate) on errors.Join(ErrDeclined, ErrDuplicate) / ErrInternal.
The join always contains ErrDuplicate, so the whole joined error is handled: expect 1 entry, ErrInternal.
Neither ErrDuplicate nor the joined ErrDeclined should remain.
